        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wernher von Braun\n- Organizations: NASA\n- Projects: V-2 rocket, Saturn V, Project Vulcan\n- Products: communication satellite program\n\nFacts:\n- Wernher von Braun was a German engineer credited with inventing the V-2 rocket.\n- Wernher von Braun was also credited with developing the Saturn V rocket.\n- On April 6, 1967, a communication satellite program was launched.\n- Wernher von Braun was a supervisor of the communication satellite program.\n- NASA was the organization behind Project Vulcan.",
